# Restriction checkboxes for WinUI3_GridColumns_v1.tt (see Docs/Reference.md section 3).
# Support code for the Columns list of every list page; it does not depend on a table. The menu offers it on the database, the CLI runs it without -t.
Scope=Database
# The template writes its own paths (ViewModels/GridColumnStore.cs, Views/GridCells.cs) with @@@FILE markers; OutputName names the file for a run by hand.
OutputName=ViewModels/GridColumnStore.cs
# Whole-project generation (codegen generate): the stacks that include this template.
Stacks=WinUI3
